<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned all three auctions whereby it had sought to drain 1.919 billion pesos from the secondary market on Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    580 million    14 days  25.20 pct</p>
<p>    780 million    11 days  25.22 pct</p>
<p>    559 million     1 day   25.19 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
